[CustomMessages]
en.RuntimeInstallTitle=Install the required runtime
zhcn.RuntimeInstallTitle=安装所需运行环境
en.RuntimeInstallSubtitle=FloatCanvas needs the .NET 10 Windows Desktop Runtime (x64).
zhcn.RuntimeInstallSubtitle=浮绘需要 .NET 10 桌面运行时（x64）。
en.RuntimeInstallMissing=The required runtime is missing. Setup can download the correct installer from Microsoft and install it for you.%n%nWindows may ask for administrator permission. After installation, Setup checks the runtime again and continues automatically. No restart will be performed automatically.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallMissing=未检测到所需运行环境。安装程序可以从微软下载正确的安装包，并为你完成安装。%n%nWindows 可能要求管理员确认。安装完成后会自动重新检测并继续安装浮绘，不会自动重启电脑。
en.RuntimeInstallAction=Download and install .NET
zhcn.RuntimeInstallAction=下载并安装 .NET
en.RuntimeInstallRetry=Check again
zhcn.RuntimeInstallRetry=重新检测
en.RuntimeInstallManual=Microsoft download page
zhcn.RuntimeInstallManual=微软官方下载页
en.RuntimeInstallDownloading=Downloading the .NET desktop runtime
zhcn.RuntimeInstallDownloading=正在下载 .NET 桌面运行时
en.RuntimeInstallDownloadDetail=Downloading the required Windows x64 runtime from Microsoft.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallDownloadDetail=正在从微软下载所需的 Windows x64 运行时。
en.RuntimeInstallRunning=Installing the .NET desktop runtime. Please respond to any Windows administrator permission prompt, then wait for installation to finish.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallRunning=正在安装 .NET 桌面运行时。如 Windows 请求管理员确认，请完成确认，然后等待安装结束。
en.RuntimeInstallChecking=Checking the installed runtime...
zhcn.RuntimeInstallChecking=正在重新检测运行环境…
en.RuntimeInstallReady=The required runtime is ready. Click Next to continue.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallReady=所需运行环境已就绪。点击“下一步”继续。
en.RuntimeInstallCancelled=Runtime installation was cancelled. You can try again or install it manually.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallCancelled=已取消运行环境安装。可以重试，也可以手动安装。
en.RuntimeInstallLaunchFailed=The runtime installer could not start: %1
zhcn.RuntimeInstallLaunchFailed=无法启动运行环境安装程序：%1
en.RuntimeInstallFailed=The runtime installer returned error %1. Try again or use the Microsoft download page.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallFailed=运行环境安装程序返回错误 %1。请重试，或使用微软官方下载页。
en.RuntimeInstallNotDetected=Installation finished, but a compatible runtime is still unavailable. Check again after restarting Windows, or check any custom DOTNET_ROOT settings before retrying.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallNotDetected=安装已结束，但仍未检测到兼容的运行环境。请重启 Windows 后重新检测，或检查自定义 DOTNET_ROOT 设置后重试。
en.RuntimeInstallRestart=The runtime installer requires a Windows restart. Save your work, restart Windows, then run FloatCanvas Setup again.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallRestart=运行环境安装程序要求重启 Windows。请先保存工作，重启后重新运行浮绘安装程序。
en.RuntimeInstallHashMismatch=The runtime download failed its integrity check. It has not been run. Please retry.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallHashMismatch=运行环境下载文件未通过完整性检查，未执行该文件。请重试。
en.RuntimeInstallDownloadFailed=Could not download the runtime: %1%n%nCheck your connection and retry, or use the Microsoft download page.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallDownloadFailed=无法下载运行环境：%1%n%n请检查网络后重试，或使用微软官方下载页。
en.RuntimeInstallBrowserFailed=The Microsoft download page could not be opened. Visit https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/10.0 and select Windows Desktop Runtime x64.
zhcn.RuntimeInstallBrowserFailed=无法打开微软下载页面。请访问 https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/10.0 并选择 Windows Desktop Runtime x64。
